WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:05.471
-Well, these are difficult times
to do an entertainment show.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:07.674
These are difficult times
to do any show.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.611
But these are also times when
we need each other the most.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:16.416
In times like these, I think to
myself, "How is this happening?

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.484
How can this be happening?"

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:21.120
But I'm also thinking,
"How can I help?"

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.456
And being here tonight
and talking to you at home

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.359
and reassuring you that
we are going to be okay

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.695
and that this is not what
our country is about

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.396
is how I can help.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:32.665
This is what happens when
there is no peaceful transition

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:36.235
of power and what happens
when there is bad leadership.

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:38.704
This is not how you lose.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:41.074
If my grandfather were alive
today and saw what

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.710
was happening in the country
that he fought for,

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.278
he'd be disgusted.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:48.648
People walking around with
the flag upside down,

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.549
thinking they're patriotic.

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:52.852
Today was not patriotism.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.521
Today was terrorism.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.725
I thought that
President-elect Biden --

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.560
President Biden said
it best when he said,

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.095
"We have to step up.

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:05.564
We're at our
best when we step up."

00:01:05.564 --> 00:01:07.800
We've seen it over and over
again during this pandemic,

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.103
from the front-line workers to
the cashiers at grocery stores

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:13.506
to everyone delivering food
or raising money

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.140
for people who need it.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:18.477
We are best when we
work together and step up.

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:21.414
But President Biden also said
something after his speech

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.215
that hit me even harder.

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:26.652
He said,
"Enough is enough is enough."

00:01:26.652 --> 00:01:29.121
And I believe that is what
a majority of this country

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:33.593
has been saying, has been
screaming for a long time now.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.261
Enough is enough.

00:01:36.261 --> 00:01:38.264
Today was a disgrace.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.032
Today was disappointing.

00:01:40.032 --> 00:01:43.236
But, sadly,
today was not a surprise.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.039
But it's important to remember
that this is not who we are.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:49.842
I assure you there are more
good people than there are bad

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:52.345
and good will prevail.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:53.446
Thank you for watching.

